"  F1 Jobs   Settings                                                            "
"╭ Settings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│   Config file       /home/user/.config/leeroy/config.toml                    │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│   Jenkins URL       (not set)                                                │"
"│   Skip TLS verify   off                                                      │"
"│   Proxy URL         (not set; direct connection)                             │"
"│   Auto-refresh      on                                                       │"
"│   Refresh every     10 s (default)                                           │"
"│   Confirm quit      on                                                       │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│   Headers                                                                    │"
"│ ▶ + add header      Authorization: Basic s3cret█                             │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│   Extra HTTP headers sent with every request to Jenkins, e.g. for            │"
"│   authentication.                                                            │"
"│   Edit as "Name: value"; clear the field to remove it. Values are masked,    │"
"│   except while editing.                                                      │"
"│   Examples:                                                                  │"
"│     Authorization: Basic <base64 of user:password>                           │"
"╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯"
" Edit   Enter  save   Esc  cancel   ↑/↓  save & move   ←/→  cursor   C-u  clear "
